-[![CI](https://github.com/aspose-slides-foss/Aspose.Slides-FOSS-for-.NET/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/aspose-slides-foss/Aspose.Slides-FOSS-for-.NET/actions/workflows/ci.yml)
